# Workers Static Assets serves this file's rules on every non-API response
# (api/* runs through the Worker middleware, which sets its own headers).
# R5-P3 anti-framing: the SPA's meta CSP cannot carry frame-ancestors (spec-
# ignored in meta), so the authenticated UI was iframe-embeddable. This
# closes the clickjacking surface at the platform level.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
